Number: 32
Description: A 13-wide diamond (one square at top and bottom, a 13-square middle row) with a cross-shaped panel over the centre (shown as _: r4c6, r5c5-c7, r6c4-c8, r7c5-c7, r8c6); the numbers are printed inside the end squares.
